d": 1787516968, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233528039", "author": {"steamid": "76561198195973598", "personaname": "Black Arrow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/blackarrow1173/", "num_games_owned": 135, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2679, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2679, "last_played": 1786307245, "avatar": "67f9fc6a5ce3eae5e05334cc9c43354d0298cd2e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Este es un juegazo para estar con los colegas para pasar un buen rato. Además la sátira que usa para criticar a los pensamientos ultraradicalizados es algo precioso, siempre y cuando la gente sepa que es una sátira y no crean que de verdad lo que muestra la historia es algo bueno, vamos como warhammer... \n(Creo que voy a tener varios hater con esta reseña). \n\nUno de los pocos juegos como servicio que no te comen con publicidad ni técnicas depredatoras para comprar su pase que dura solo un mes y después desaparece para siempre. Todo lo que ayude al consumidor es bueno para todos. \n\nEn definitiva, juegazo, muy entretenido y para un par de tardes con colegas es perfecto. Por supertierra.", "timestamp_created": 1787504804, "timestamp_updated": 1787504804, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233516188", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087081577", "personaname": "Peterghostex", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/peterghostex/", "num_games_owned": 89, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 5115, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1441, "playtime_at_review": 4750, "last_played": 1787617475, "avatar": "cdeea09d0f39857e15474c3b7283a6df92b771af"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Está guapardo, cuanto menos en serio te lo tomas, mas divertido es.\r\nAl principio puede ser un poco abrumador, pero poco a poco te vas familiarizando con todo.\r\nLo peor? tener que farmear para los warbonds (o pagarlos). Y estos son importantes, cambian la dinámica de juego, permite hacer builds más elaboradas y acceder a armas mejores en general. \r\nPOR SUPERTIERRA!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1787495810, "timestamp_updated": 1787495810, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31849", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 7600 6-Core Processor              ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti", "vram_size": 16050}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233514820", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020054157", "personaname": "yul yul", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020054157/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1934, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1934, "playtime_at_review": 1032, "last_played": 1787955691, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Democracy", "timestamp_created": 1787494745, "timestamp_updated": 1787494745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]